  "notes": "FORMATION: {激|げき} (intense, extreme) + {減|げん} (decrease). The prefix {激|げき} intensifies the degree of change.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {人口|じんこう}が{激減|げきげん}する: population drops sharply\n- {収入|しゅうにゅう}が{激減|げきげん}する: income decreases drastically\n- {激減|げきげん}の{原因|げんいん}: cause of the sharp decline\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {激減|げきげん}: dramatic decrease (emphasizes severity)\n- {減少|げんしょう}: decrease (neutral, general term)\n- {急減|きゅうげん}: rapid decrease (emphasizes speed)\n- {激増|げきぞう}: dramatic increase (antonym)",
